 [00:14:56\u8211\'9600:15:27]\line And that thought for them is not of the stuff from the neck up, but only from the neck down, which to me was really intriguing. And so I only raise this because there have to be, as you point out, there's an infinite number of different sort of orientations based on our unique DNA and experience. But what do you think explains why these particular seeds, or as you point out, the direction that the grain runs in the brain. I mean, it's partially going to be nature, it's going to be DNA.}
